# Files copied from the primary checkout into every new Task worktree.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout: gitignored local files do not exist there. List the
# ones a new checkout genuinely needs. Patterns use .gitignore syntax, and a file is only
# copied when it is BOTH matched here AND ignored by git — tracked files are never
# duplicated, because the checkout already has them.
#
# Credentials are refused no matter what is written here: .env (except *.example /
# *.sample / *.template), *.pem, *.key, *.p12, *.pfx, *.jks, id_rsa*/id_ed25519*/…,
# .npmrc, .netrc, .git-credentials, *credential*/*secret*/*token*, settings.local.json,
# and deploy/config.*.yaml. `bun scripts/worktree/cli.mjs doctor` fails if a pattern here
# targets one of them.
#
# No pattern is active by default: the shipped configuration copies nothing, so a new
# worktree never silently receives local state. Add patterns below when a checkout needs
# them, for example:
#
#   .vscode/settings.json
#   apps/desktop/.desktop-dev/config.json
